---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Reviews"
metaTitle: "Customer Reviews"
metaDescription: "What customers across Winchcombe, Cheltenham and the Cotswolds say about Jackson's Stonemasonry — dry stone walling, restoration and stone wall repair reviews."
permalink: "/reviews/"
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Don&rsquo;t just take our word for it</p>
    <h1>Customer Reviews</h1>
    {% if reviews.placeholder %}
    <p class="lede">Most of our work comes from recommendation — a wall a neighbour had rebuilt, a frontage someone walked past.</p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="lede">Most of our work comes from recommendation — a wall a neighbour had rebuilt, a frontage someone walked past. Here's what customers say about working with us.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {# Note for whoever edits this file: reviews.json is still placeholders, so
       nothing is rendered here. Replace them with genuine customer reviews
       (with permission — ideally copied from the Google Business Profile so the
       site and Google agree), set "placeholder" to false, and the grid below
       comes back on its own. Never publish invented reviews. #}
    {% if not reviews.placeholder %}
    <div class="review-grid">
      {%- for r in reviews.items %}
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="review__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote class="review__quote">{{ r.quote }}</blockquote>
        <figcaption class="review__by">{{ r.name }}{% if r.location %}, {{ r.location }}{% endif %}{% if r.service %}<br><span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft)">{{ r.service }}</span>{% endif %}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if site.googleBusinessProfileUrl %}
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ site.googleBusinessProfileUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read our reviews on Google</a></p>
    {% endif %}

    <h2>Had work done by us?</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">A short Google review makes a real difference to a small local business — if we've done work for you, we'd be very grateful. And if anything wasn't right, tell us first: <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneInternational }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>. We'd rather fix it than read about it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
